[View: WorkItemDetail]
route: /*/browse/*
memory:
  - The page title (document.title) is "<KEY> <work item title>" — cheapest way to confirm which item is open
  - The right-hand properties panel buttons (state, assignees, dates, labels) have no stable attributes; they are reachable only by accessible name (e.g. button "Add assignees")
  - Changing state opens a headlessui listbox; options are buttons named Backlog/Todo/In Progress/Done/Cancelled

